2. OpenStreetMap-derived maps
-----------------------------

The files under data/osm_derived/ are proxy-priority grids derived from
OpenStreetMap data for the Seoul area (latitude 37.413-37.715, longitude
126.734-127.269). OpenStreetMap data is (c) OpenStreetMap contributors and is
available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

As a derivative of that database, data/osm_derived/ is distributed under the
same ODbL 1.0 terms. If you redistribute these grids or works derived from them,
keep this attribution and license notice.

